exa: synchronize CPU access to DMA-BUF pixmaps

DRI3 clients may render with the GPU while Xorg reads or writes the same mapped
storage. Emit matching DMA_BUF_SYNC_START and END ioctls around the outermost
EXA access to prevent partially updated rows.

Based on termux/termux-x11@d85d65c7809c53c1707cb771fa8e4e645cc9f3ea.

